=== FILE: README.md ===
# ai-standup-assistant

Generates a structured daily standup by aggregating activity across configured GitHub repos. Reports yesterday's commits and merged PRs, today's work in progress (open PRs, in-flight issues), and blockers (PRs awaiting review, issues stalled beyond a threshold). Renders the result to the 'Today's Standup' Cowork artifact card.

## Workflows

- **"run standup"** — Aggregates the user's last-24h GitHub activity across configured projects, classifies into yesterday/today/blockers, renders per the user's chosen format, and refreshes the Today's Standup artifact card.

## Installation

This is an A3IP package. To install it, give the `.a3ip.bundle` file to
your AI assistant and ask it to install the package.

The AI will guide you through the configuration wizard and set everything up.

## Platforms

- cowork
- codex
- claude-code

## Author

Maksym Prydorozhko <maksym.prydorozhko@gmail.com>

=== END FILE ===
